   "title": "About this scene",
   "text": "Concept: Cornelius van Heerden. This scene is a composition of existing atoms (choropleth_map, sankey_flow with keyed true, motion_transition, motion_shape particles on motion_path-style tracks, a camera track); no visual design or branding of the concept is copied. Figures are illustrative, not statistics. Particles are capped at 200 on screen (this film draws 108: 18 dots, each with a 5-copy trail), because they get heavy on low-end devices. Reduced motion and the poster frame show the settled state: the flat Sankey, with its text table. Free drag-orbit and depth-curved lit ribbons need WebGL and are out of scope."
